      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `c7fb150dfea31a121a01f6478cf722e5f9d639b48d7ca133e3da3987b73be6e1--recorded-crime-offenders-2011-12-cube-2-archive-member.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Offenders (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2011-12\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 8 of 8\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 2ac29fb168d88982e6d3e83e5700e170083d5fb6218610c6b7e369e72fc84601 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | f24809c44f4fa75f1812a6e26917f9bfac061da06a85b50a1da5a4253f79bad1 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 890c6f62e02d5841a1ff3435a54d226c691e1ccea0464040d6e0e1db17d45853 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 8b065e86ef8fa9c37d0f8e09cbcc0890125e0b171fac037486ece0922690353b | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 749c9969d87dfc214375ca02ee67762c8da3445cab084bada300d2a4ff6ebbea | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 24a00bec3857654b2b2a2630fe8b9799b71958af6c8bbefa664da496eb348396 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 339a86eec2d6e536068e0724c6a46d393ba47f912b85fc84016bace12c80d6ca | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 1e7aa3f091eb7d075c719eec4eaadf72f4d2b60b97799c15684f165447c97575 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
